"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4985060","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2606850-1841579228668540","game_id":"steam-2606850","kind":"announcement","title":"Gamescom 2026","summary":"MIMIC IS COMING TO GAMESCOM!We’re heading to Gamescom in Cologne next week!If you’re attending, keep an eye out for Ryan Laley around the show. Come over, say hello, tell me you’re following Mimic and I’ll give you a FREE Steam key for the game! 🔑No competition. No giveaway. Find me. Get a key.Come chat about Mimic, games, horror, Unreal Engine; or just grab yourself a copy ahead of Early Access.📍 Gamescom 2026 – Cologne 📅 26–30 AugustKeys will be limited, so once they're gone, they're gone.See ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T12:15:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228668540","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2606850-1833334318580364","game_id":"steam-2606850","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Patch 0.9.22","summary":"✨ New Features Host migration for Matchmaking 🧠 Improvements Reworked Android Behavior; Androids will now search rooms properly for players. They have better tracking and monitoring of the previous room their target was in. Objectives have been reworked to better support scalability for future objectives. Increased default volume for in-game proximity voice chat. 🐛 Bug Fixes Fixed gas cannisters and the objectives Valves now hide the wheel properly if it is deemed missing You should be able to l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-26T20:47:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318580364","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2606850-1832700592801712","game_id":"steam-2606850","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Patch 0.9.21","summary":"✨ New Features Collections menu has been expanded to now include Secrets, Achievements, Manifests, and Codex Entries. 🧠 Improvements Reworked hunter vision implementation for Mimics. New camera view for when getting killed. Stomp animation added for Mimic being killed by the Android. Added extra sound effects to number of interactions such as lockers. 🐛 Bug Fixes Corrected collision issue with door widgets for Mimics Corrected collisions with electrical room Corrected collisions for Omen. Made i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-19T18:51:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592801712","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2606850-1832065502823192","game_id":"steam-2606850","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Patch 0.9.20","summary":"🧠 Improvements Pinging a player will now increase suspicion by 0.3 (up from 0.1) Pings now have a cooldown of 5.0 seconds (up from 2.0 seconds) Adjusted audio levels for ambient tracks. Adjusted lighting in some areas in Icarus map. Mimic skin integrity will now drop at a slower rate but with a lesser top-end value. 🐛 Bug Fixes Affix menu can now be closed in private lobbies. Character select's back button will now return you. Valves in H. Lab now display a progress bar. Oxygenator can no longer","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-12T08:03:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502823192","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2606850-1831432155577838","game_id":"steam-2606850","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Patch Notes – 0.9.19","summary":"✨ New Features Matchmaking; updated and improved flow into matchmaking into random matches. Private Lobby; Create and host private lobbies that you can then invite friends and/or share a room code to allow them to join. 🎮 Gameplay Changes Lockers can now be randomly locked/unlocked with a new light indicator on its mesh. 🧠 Improvements New audio effects added throughout the Icarus. New Auto-Login flow implemented. 🐛 Bug Fixes Omen camera effects will no longer affect other players. Valves can no","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T15:55:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155577838","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2606850-1830797770245391","game_id":"steam-2606850","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Patch 0.9.18","summary":"🎮 Gameplay Changes Whilst in Mimic form, you periodically alert the Android to your location. The period between these alerts decreases the longer you remain in Mimic form. This encourages the Mimic player to not remain in their Mimic form and to return to human form. 🧠 Improvements Improved the range of proximity chat to be easier to hear and communicate. 🐛 Bug Fixes Item name has been changed on the gas cannister to be more consistent. Minimap objectives should now only show the three objectiv","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-28T13:32:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770245391","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2606850-1830163047265599","game_id":"steam-2606850","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Patch 0.9.17","summary":"✨ New Features Upgraded to UE5.7 Added proximity chat 🎮 Gameplay Changes Mimic player begins with 2 energy instead of 3 🧠 Improvements Android AI will not target recently attacked crew members Player pings now have a cooldown associated to them, variable to the target that they are pinging. Reworked Sus calculation and backend systems Altered music to be centred around the Android and the chase status. Added interactable lockers Corrected collision issues found in the Icarus map. 🐛 Bug Fixes Fir","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-20T10:37:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047265599","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2606850-1829528821315481","game_id":"steam-2606850","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Patch 0.9.16","summary":"🎮 Gameplay Changes Added a 'No Mimic Zone' that blocks access to the Mimic form character. This means the Mimic character must be in human form in order to enter the Launch Bay of the Icarus. 🧠 Improvements Mimic skin integrity has had its default starting value increased by 300% Decreased camera shake from Android footsteps. Added hints for many pickups Added initial hints for objectives to help players get started with them.🐛 Bug Fixes Android AI behaviour towards hunt targets has been reorgan","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-13T13:37:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821315481","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2606850-1828894815565154","game_id":"steam-2606850","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes – 0.9.15","summary":"🛠️ Patch Notes – 0.9.15 Date: 06 April 2026 This update focuses on general fixes from previous playtest as well as some UX/UI updates for objectives. ✨ New Features Players can now enter a custom display name for their character Accessibility Assistant; get hints on how to get started and progress through a match. This will be available to be turned off or on in a future patch but will be on by default. 🎮 Gameplay Changes Increased time limit of a match by 300% by default Added the fuel inserter","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-06T12:48:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815565154","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2606850-1828441623109850","game_id":"steam-2606850","kind":"update","title":"Pre-release Update 14","summary":"Gameplay ChangesOmens now have the camera set lower to the ground with wider FOV.ImprovementsNew animations for when Mimic creature attacks Crew members including new VFX.Bug FixesInstalling server blades will now remove the 'Drop Current Item' UI element.Progress bar for interactions will now stay full upon completion.Omen's can no longer crouch.Omen's can now pass through fire correctly.Interact messages for Electrical actors is now behaving correctly.You can no longer Ping every object in the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-30T13:41:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623109850","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2606850-1825727806716241","game_id":"steam-2606850","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcing PlayMimic.com – The Official Website for Mimic!","summary":"We’re excited to officially launch PlayMimic.com, the brand new home for Mimic outside of Steam!The website will be your central hub for:📰 Latest news and development updates🗺️ Roadmap insights📸 Screenshots and media❓ FAQs and helpful info🔮 Future announcementsAs we continue developing Mimic through Early Access, we want to improve how we communicate with the community, and PlayMimic.com is a big step toward that. 💬 Join the Official Community DiscordIf you haven’t already, we highly recommend j","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-02T01:28:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806716241","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2606850-1813674388974609","game_id":"steam-2606850","kind":"announcement","title":"Mimic Dev Vlog: 01 // Making a Monster","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-17T15:26:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813674388974609","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2606850-6931694080290994208","game_id":"steam-2606850","kind":"announcement","title":"MCM x EGX 2024","summary":"Excited to announce that Mimic will be at MCM x EGX 2024. The game will be on show and playable across all 3 days. I (Ryan) will be there all 3 days too so feel free to come by and say hi!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-10-10T10:13:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6931694080290994208","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2606850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2606850":"2026-10-26T09:54:42Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2606850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:42Z","status":"ok","e